Hi,

koi8-u.7 was not the only character set page displaying lowercase
hexadecimal numbers. The inline patch (and the gzipped one
attached, hopefully not messing with encoding) address this
minor issue for armscii-8.7 (other will follow, capitalized
number are mostly used, and that is the way they are presented in
Unicode.


